{"id":"b992991a5a3d22fd","group":"17","path":"17/17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language.md","title":"Craig Interpolation Theorem","display":"thm-craig-interpolation-common-language — Craig Interpolation Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_section":"2.2","source_result":"Theorem 2.2.20 (Craig)","source_pages_print":"87–88","source_pages_djvu":"103–104","source_verification":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed","type":"theorem","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language","aliases":["17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language"],"display":"thm-craig-interpolation-common-language — Craig Interpolation Theorem","depends_on":["[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-sentence]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]","[[17-df-language-operations]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-thm-9.1.1b","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_section","html":"2.2"},{"key":"source_result","html":"Theorem 2.2.20 (Craig)"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"87–88"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"103–104"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"OCR checked for the stated source and scope; mathematical translation reviewed"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-craig-interpolation-common-language — Craig Interpolation Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a9aca16de79beda9\" href=\"?note=a9aca16de79beda9\" title=\"17-thm-craig-interpolation\">17-thm-craig-interpolation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c533bc9800efd71c\" href=\"?note=c533bc9800efd71c\" title=\"17-df-language-operations\">17-df-language-operations</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-thm-9.1.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Compatible}(L_\\varphi,L_\\psi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Compatible}(L_\\varphi,L_\\psi)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=L_\\varphi\\cup L_\\psi\">\\(L=L_\\varphi\\cup L_\\psi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0=L_\\varphi\\cap L_\\psi\">\\(L_0=L_\\varphi\\cap L_\\psi\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c533bc9800efd71c\" href=\"?note=c533bc9800efd71c\" title=\"17-df-language-operations\">17-df-language-operations</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi}\">\\(\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi}\\)</span>；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-结构上的句子真值按该句所在子语言的约化解释。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>有限元组满足记号取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4ec60741c4296112\" href=\"?note=4ec60741c4296112\" title=\"17-df-tuple-satisfaction\">17-df-tuple-satisfaction</a>，每个使用处的显示变量须覆盖公式的自由变量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\varphi,L_\\psi,L_0,L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L_\\varphi,L_\\psi,L_0,L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span> (first-order languages, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The four languages use the same variable and logical-symbol components. Their nonlogical symbols are compatible: a shared symbol has the same kind and arity, and their combined symbol families remain disjoint by kind and arity. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const},\\mathrm{Func},\\mathrm{Rel}\">\\(\\mathrm{Const},\\mathrm{Func},\\mathrm{Rel}\\)</span> denote the projections from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi},\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi},\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi},\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi},\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}\\)</span> (sentence classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"1280f7fa724c1502\" href=\"?note=1280f7fa724c1502\" title=\"17-df-sentence\">17-df-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (structures and truth, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"528afa8a8db7f8be\" href=\"?note=528afa8a8db7f8be\" title=\"17-df-sentence-truth\">17-df-sentence-truth</a>)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L_\\varphi,L_\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Const}_L=\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\varphi}\\cup\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\psi}\n\\land\\mathrm{Const}_{L_0}=\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\varphi}\\cap\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\psi}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\psi,n}\n\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\psi,n}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\mathrm{Func}_{L_0,n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cap\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\psi,n}\n\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_0,n}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\psi,n}\\Bigr]\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi}\n\\land\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi}\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\to\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\to\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta\\to\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&amp;L_\\varphi,L_\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Const}_L=\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\varphi}\\cup\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\psi}\n\\land\\mathrm{Const}_{L_0}=\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\varphi}\\cap\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\psi}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\psi,n}\n\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\psi,n}\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\mathrm{Func}_{L_0,n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cap\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\psi,n}\n\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_0,n}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\psi,n}\\Bigr]\n\\\\\n&amp;\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi}\n\\land\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi}\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\to\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\to\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\to\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta)\n\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{28mm}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta\\to\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This chapter-level statement is the same interpolation theorem formalized in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"a9aca16de79beda9\" href=\"?note=a9aca16de79beda9\" title=\"17-thm-craig-interpolation\">17-thm-craig-interpolation</a>, with the common language and semantic entailments made explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The common and combined languages are constructed by their symbol projections; literal set union of the five-component language codes would not express these operations.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-sentence-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-craig-interpolation","status":"resolved","id":"a9aca16de79beda9","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-operations","status":"resolved","id":"c533bc9800efd71c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-operations]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-operations","status":"resolved","id":"c533bc9800efd71c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Compatible}(L_\\varphi,L_\\psi)$，$L=L_\\varphi\\cup L_\\psi$，$L_0=L_\\varphi\\cap L_\\psi$；见 [[17-df-language-operations]]。$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi}$，$\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi}$；在 $L$-结构上的句子真值按该句所在子语言的约化解释。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-tuple-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"4ec60741c4296112","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有限元组满足记号取 [[17-df-tuple-satisfaction]]，每个使用处的显示变量须覆盖公式的自由变量。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L_\\varphi,L_\\psi,L_0,L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$ (first-order languages, see [[17-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"The four languages use the same variable and logical-symbol components. Their nonlogical symbols are compatible: a shared symbol has the same kind and arity, and their combined symbol families remain disjoint by kind and arity. $\\mathrm{Const},\\mathrm{Func},\\mathrm{Rel}$ denote the projections from [[17-df-first-order-language]].","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"1280f7fa724c1502","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi},\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi},\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}$ (sentence classes, see [[17-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ and $\\models$ (structures and truth, see [[17-df-structure]] and [[17-df-sentence-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-sentence-truth","status":"resolved","id":"528afa8a8db7f8be","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ and $\\models$ (structures and truth, see [[17-df-structure]] and [[17-df-sentence-truth]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-thm-craig-interpolation","status":"resolved","id":"a9aca16de79beda9","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"This chapter-level statement is the same interpolation theorem formalized in [[17-thm-craig-interpolation]], with the common language and semantic entailments made explicit.","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Compatible}(L_\\varphi,L_\\psi)","display":false},{"tex":"L=L_\\varphi\\cup L_\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"L_0=L_\\varphi\\cap L_\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi}","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\varphi,L_\\psi,L_0,L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const},\\mathrm{Func},\\mathrm{Rel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi},\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi},\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\quad\n&L_\\varphi,L_\\psi\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\n\\land\n\\mathrm{Const}_L=\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\varphi}\\cup\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\psi}\n\\land\\mathrm{Const}_{L_0}=\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\varphi}\\cap\\mathrm{Const}_{L_\\psi}\n\\\\\n&\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cup\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\psi,n}\n\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cup\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\psi,n}\n\\\\\n&\\hspace{24mm}\\land\\mathrm{Func}_{L_0,n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cap\\mathrm{Func}_{L_\\psi,n}\n\\land\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_0,n}=\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\varphi,n}\\cap\\mathrm{Rel}_{L_\\psi,n}\\Bigr]\n\\\\\n&\\land\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\varphi}\n\\land\n\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_\\psi}\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\to\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi)\n\\\\\n&\\to\n\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_0}\\;\n\\Bigl[\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\varphi\\to\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta)\n\\\\\n&\\hspace{28mm}\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n(\\mathfrak M\\models\\theta\\to\\mathfrak M\\models\\psi)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":3612,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-169","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language]]\n[[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]\n[[17-thm-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-thm-ehrenfeucht-mostowski]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-amalgamation]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-chain-union]]\n[[17-thm-elementary-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-erdos-rado]]\n[[17-thm-existential-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-extended-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-finite-ramsey]]\n[[17-thm-fraisse-limit]]\n[[17-thm-horn-axiomatization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-horn-sentence-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-horn-theory-reduced-products]]\n[[17-thm-isomorphic-ultrapowers]]\n[[17-thm-keisler-shelah]]\n[[17-thm-keisler-shelah-predicate-form]]\n[[17-thm-lindstrom]]\n[[17-thm-los]]\n[[17-thm-los-quotient-form]]\n[[17-thm-los-vaught]]\n[[17-thm-lowenheim-skolem-tarski]]\n[[17-thm-model-companion-uniqueness]]\n[[17-thm-model-completeness-existential-test]]\n[[17-thm-model-completeness-formula-test]]\n[[17-thm-model-completeness-substructure-test]]\n[[17-thm-model-comple